<title>UK: Major says thinks UK Conservatives will win.</title>
<headline>Major says thinks UK Conservatives will win.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK Prime Minister John Major said at a news conference outside Downing Street that he thinks his ruling party will win the May 1 election.</p>
</text>
